==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etym|gmh|de}} {{term|ber|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|beri|lang=goh}}, originally a neuter. The feminine gender is from {{etym|gml|de}} {{term|bere|lang=gml}} ({{g|f}}). Cognate with {{etym|en|-}} {{term|berry|lang=en}} and eventually {{etym|nl|-}} {{term|bes|lang=nl}}.

